        "title": "Realize the value of Life",
        "text": "This temple is beautiful and meaningful in many aspects. One can learn about life from this place. It is so peaceful to stay at the top and watch the \"Aarati- Reverence.\" Life is so busy yet peaceful. On the other hand, you can see the end of life here. The dead bodies are cremated here. This makes us realize the value of life: at the end, we are taking nothing with us. So live happily and spread happiness.",
